e angry</strong></p>\n","answers":["yell","sign","giggle"],"subContentId":"63e82fb2-7c62-4d7f-a11a-3c40bebf9459"},{"question":"<p><strong>10. to make a long deep sound because you are in pain or annoyed</strong></p>\n","answers":["groan","mumble","whisper"],"subContentId":"efa9545e-d152-4bc9-93eb-636732526f1e"},{"question":"<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong>c)&nbsp; &nbsp;Tick &nbsp;A, B, or C to complete the sentences. </strong></p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">Example: The sound of people ________ their drink drives me mad!<br>\n<strong>A&nbsp; slurping</strong>&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;B&nbsp; &nbsp;crunching &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; C&nbsp; splashing&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><strong>11. The sound of my colleague ______ his fingers on his desk really bothers me.</strong></p>\n","answers":["tapping","ticking","hum"],"subContentId":"b0a3fa37-ee61-4cf4-9070-7825915597e8"},{"question":"<p><strong>12. Leo stormed out of the room and ______ the door angrily.</strong></p>\n","answers":["slammed","crashed","screeched"],"subContentId":"1d5ce892-6a81-48e2-a0c1-072f240a30d1"},{"question":"<p><strong>13. My housemate Ben ________ so loudly I can hear him from my room.</strong></p>\n","answers":["snores","rattles","sniffs"],"subContentId":"b56667e8-74d6-43b1-a78a-93e7b18e11ba"},{"question":"<p><strong>14. The tap in the kitchen has been ________ for days now.</strong></p>\n","answers":["dripping","clicking","tapping"],"subContentId":"c9f74668-af80-4926-a66f-d556f27448ca"},{"question":"<p><strong>15. The ________ of my alarm clock wakes me up at 6.30.</strong></p>\n","answers":["buzz","hiss","drip"],"subContentId":"01e78c25-2d40-4c8c-bea4-38f21f586798"},{"question":"<p><strong>16. Before the band began to play, the crowd let out a huge ________.</strong></p>\n","answers":["roar","tick","creak"],"subContentId":"c94073d3-99ae-4628-9fe8-3e31a466825d"},{"question":"<p><strong>17. The brakes on my bicycle make a loud ________ w